    <b>A / D or Left / Right</b> 
    Move

    <b>W / Space</b>  Jump; press again in the air to double-jump

    <b>Left
    Shift</b>  Dash


    <b><color=#E8C47A>EXPLORE & INTERACT</color></b>

    <b>E</b> 
    Talk to nearby NPCs, read signs, and enter available portals

    <b>E / Space
    / Enter</b>  Reveal or advance dialogue

    <b>Left click</b>  Choose dialogue
    options and use on-screen buttons

    <b>E / Esc</b>  Close a tutorial sign;
    <b>Esc</b> closes dialogue

    Touch an enemy to begin battle. Open chests using
    their interaction prompt.


    <b><color=#E8C47A>JOURNALS & MENUS</color></b>

    <b>M</b> 
    Show / hide the minimap

    <b>Q or click the Quest Journal header</b>  Minimize
    / expand quests

    <b>I</b>  Open / close inventory; <b>Esc</b> also closes
    inventory

    Click the settings icon to open Settings; use Resume to return


    <b><color=#E8C47A>BATTLE</color></b>

    Hover
    over a card to inspect it. Drag a targeted card onto an enemy to play it.

    Answer
    the programming question using the answer buttons or input field.

    Use <b>End
    Turn</b> to finish your turn. Use <b>Retreat</b> to leave a battle.


    <b><color=#E8C47A>SAVING</color></b>

    Choose
    Play in the main menu to create or continue one of three save slots.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
