      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#E8C47A>THE TOWER CALLS</color>


    At The RiftSpire, an elf
    awaits a new adventurer. Beyond its walls lie unfamiliar paths, restless creatures,
    and questions that cannot be answered by a blade alone.


    Every challenge
    is a lesson. Read carefully, think through each problem, and turn your knowledge
    of code into the strength to survive. Your cards and your choices will shape
    each battle.


    The next page of Code Escapade belongs to you.'
